# Trained model artifacts must never be line-ending converted.
#
# LightGBM ships its booster as a .txt file, so a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites its ~2,000 newlines to CRLF.  LightGBM's parser
# rejects that with a NATIVE abort ("Model format error, expect a tree here"),
# which kills the interpreter -- it is not a Python exception, so the agent's
# try/except fallbacks cannot catch it and Agent() dies at construction.
# With RERANK_MODEL=gbdt as the default, that is a hard crash on a fresh
# Windows clone.
starter/reranker/artifacts*/*.txt  -text
starter/reranker/artifacts*/*.json -text
*.npz binary
*.npy binary

# Keep source normalised as usual.
*.py text
*.md text
